// A predicate that DuckDB cannot spell ends the stages that the query takes,
// so the second `where` and the summary stay in the pipeline, with the result
// of `table_summarize.tql`. Only the pipeline warns about the field of the
// null struct `meta`, which DuckDB reads as `NULL`.
from_duckdb env("DUCKDB_SEED"), table="events"
where id > 1 or name == null
where id.string() != ""
summarize ok, n=count(), names=count(name), first=min(id), latest=max(ts), meta.port=max(meta.port)
sort ok
